<title>JAPAN: Nippi - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippi - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.94		vs	   13.34</p>
<p> Operating	   16 million	 vs	  219 million</p>
<p> Current	    216 million	 vs	  148 million</p>
<p> Net		   21 million	 vs	   42 million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.77 yen	  vs	    3.57 yen</p>
<p> Shares		12 million	 vs	   12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippi Inc is a top leather manufacturer.</p>
